ty of the borrower\'s personal loan minimum repayment. Must be verified for financial liquidity&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) In the case of online borrowers without collateral, The lenders run the risk of lending. Borrowers must show their financial status to the company to confirm their ability to repay their debts. The borrower will withdraw the full amount of the loan account.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) After signing this contract, both the borrower and the lender must comply with all requirements of the contract. If either party breaches the contract, the other party has the right to sue in court. The party not complying with this will have to pay a fine of 50 percent of the installment amount if it does not object.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) In the event that the credit transfer cannot be resolved due to the problems of the borrower, the lender has the right to request the borrower to assist in handling it. After completing this operation, the lender has to transfer the funds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) The borrower shall repay the loan principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. If the borrower wants to apply for loan extension, he/she has to disburse it 5 days before the contract period.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (6) If theborrower does not repay on time on the stipulated repayment date, penalty interest will be calculated after three days at 0.5% per day.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 5</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lending: Before granting a loan, the lender has the right to consider the following matters and take a decision to grant the loan as a result of the review:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The Borrower has entered into this Agreement Completion of legal formalities (if any) relating to the loan under the Act, such as regulatory delivery of government permits, approvals, registrations and relevant laws;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) whether the Borrower has paid the costs associated with this Agreement (if any);</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) whether the borrower has complied with the loan terms specified in this Agreement;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) whether the business and financial position of the borrower has changed adversely;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) If the Borrower breaches the terms specified in this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 6</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The borrower cannot use the loan for illegal activities. Otherwise, the Lender reserves the right to require the Borrower to repay the principal and interest promptly and the legal consequences shall be borne by the Borrower.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) The borrower shall repay the principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. For the overdue portion, the lender is entitled to recover the loan and collect 5% of the total amount due.&lt;br /&gt;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 7</strong></p>\r\n<p>Modification or termination of contract: In all of the above provisions, neither party is permitted to modify or terminate the contract without permission. When either party wishes to bring to the fore such facts in accordance with the provisions of the law, he must notify the other party in writing in time for the settlement. After this Agreement is modified or terminated, the Borrower shall repay 30% to the principal and interest in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 8</strong></p>\r\n<p>Dispute Resolution: Both parties agree to amend the terms of this Agreement through negotiation. If the negotiations do not agree, you can ask the local arbitration committee to mediate or bring the matter to a local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 9</strong></p>\r\n<p>The lender assumes the credit risk of the borrower. Due to the \"new corona pandemic\", the central office requires borrowers to purchase personal accident insurance. If the borrower is unable to repay the loan on time due to force mature, the lender may ask the insurance company to assist in the payment of the borrower\'s loan and the loan should be transferred to the borrower\'s account. Borrowing is specified in the internal contract. Half an hour after the purchase, if the borrower signs the contract but does not comply with the terms, the company considers it a serious fraud and will take the credit dispute to the people\'s court. The anti-contract king is also presented. After purchase, if the lender does not lend on time, the borrower has the right to sue directly in the local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 10</strong></p>\r\n<p>This short loan agreement takes effect from the date of its signing by both parties (including the electronic agreement). The text of the contract has the same legal effect. The lender and borrower keep a copy of the contract.</p>\r\n<p>Lender: Credit</p>\r\n<p>Borrower:</p>\";s:15:\"currency_symbol\";s:3:\"₱\";s:20:\"default_credit_score\";s:2:\"30\";s:14:\"default_locale\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"faqs_json\";s:1284:\"[{\"q\":\"What are the loan terms?\",\"a\":\"Step one, you have to fill all your personal information required in the application and you need to have an ID card or any of equivalent identification and a bank account to apply for the loan.\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take to apply for a loan each time?\",\"a\":\"From the time of registration, verification of personal information will be considered at the earliest and will continue till the final stage of delivery within 1 hour, please contact customer service staff for more specific information.\"},{\"q\":\"How to check loan?\",\"a\":\"You can visit (website) - (List of Loan Criteria) It usually takes 1-24 hours to get approved\"},{\"q\":\"How to get refund after credit line is approved?\",\"a\":\"After the loan is successful, the payment method will be deducted from your bank account on 15th of every month. If the balance is not enough to pay off, it will adversely affect your information and lead to bad debts in future.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I contact the service?\",\"a\":\"You can contact (Customer Service) Customer Service Contact Department Online Time 11:00AM - 11:00PM\"},{\"q\":\"Can I sign out of my account?\",\"a\":\"Monthly service that partially \\\"cancels your account\\\" information you enter for personal protection is limited to loan applications.\"}]\";s:12:\"home_sliders\";s:361:\"[\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/SVBMCvYCy5wCm5ieC0fTxUQERdLKWRUpLlMKbEpE.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/yPRuTRX3MQwL5J1qI1DuhjjrFUbV2Yeht2dmIKsA.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/nzGPwYbYr7uyRFr8DV6negFklf7jrZ9Td315hr1S.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/y76SYQ8Gjeu6d1TNDRO7qE8PGITrSi4HzlaH8pdN.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/yIFDrctkptLwWpOuT3QH7xpWytPWQwNrAPznwnoY.jpg\"]\";s:18:\"loan_interest_rate\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:8:\"loan_max\";s:7:\"5000000\";s:8:\"loan_min\";s:5:\"80000\";s:17:\"loan_requirements\";s:175:\"{\"full_name\":true,\"id_number\":true,\"id_front\":true,\"id_back\":true,\"id_selfie\":true,\"signature\":true,\"bank_name\":true,\"bank_account\":true,\"relative_1\":false,\"relative_2\":false}\";s:10:\"loan_terms\";s:21:\"[\"12\",\"24\",\"36\",\"48\"]\";s:9:\"logo_path\";s:50:\"loanlocal/42f9dfe0-a42b-4f27-b4bf-e4dbbb5ec00f.jpg\";s:18:\"page_about_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"page_contact_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"page_contract_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:15:\"show_logo_login\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"show_logo_signup\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"theme\";s:7:\"default\";s:15:\"welcome_message\";s:19:\"Welcome to LoanApp!\";s:19:\"welcome_sub_message\";s:70:\"Thanks for creating your account. We are excited to have you on board.\";s:13:\"welcome_title\";s:7:\"Welcome\";}',1774881460);
INSERT INTO `cache` VALUES ('loanapp-cache-settings.map.11','a:24:{s:8:\"about_us\";s:2035:\"<p><strong>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc</strong></p>\r\n<p>Address: Pacific Star Bldg, Makati Avenue, 1226 Sen. Gil J. Puyat Ave, Makati, Metro Manila, Philippines<br>SEC Registration Number: CS201334706<br>Certificate of Authority Number: 1073<br>Date of Registration: 06 November 2013</p>\r\n<p><br>Since 2013, LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. has been a trusted full-service universal loan application provider in the Philippines. We are committed to delivering fast, convenient, and reliable financial solutions tailored to the needs of Filipinos and businesses nationwide. Our focus is to provide an easy and secure process for accessing loan services, offering competitive interest rates and quick approvals.</p>\r\n<p>Over the years, we have assisted thousands of clients across the country, consistently earning strong referrals and high service ratings for our dependable and efficient loan programs.</p>\r\n<p>We offer seamless document handling and help clients complete all loan requirements&mdash;including freelancers, OFWs, and non-traditional earners&mdash;without requiring collateral. Through our local subsidiaries, we maintain strong partnerships with major banks in the Philippines, providing access to a wide range of financial products such as:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Banking Loans</li>\r\n<li>Private Loans</li>\r\n<li>Leasing and Finance Personal</li>\r\n<li>Loans</li>\r\n<li>Loan Insurance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Our advantage lies in providing value-added financial services, enabling us to build long-standing relationships with clients throughout the country.</p>\r\n<p>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. remains at the forefront of fast, easy, and dependable loan service facilitation. Through strategic acquisitions and steady growth, we have strengthened our financial position and expanded into new markets. Today, the company continues on its path to becoming one of the Philippines&rsquo; leading local loan service providers in terms of total resources, customer loans, capital strength, and nationwide network.</p>\";s:14:\"agreement_page\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"contact_details\";s:165:\"<p><strong>Contact Customer Service</strong></p>\r\n<p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:%20support@loanapp.com\">support@loanapp.com</a><br>Working hours: 09:00 AM - 21:00 PM</p>\";s:13:\"contract_page\";s:6377:\"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Name of the borrower: [full_name]</p>\r\n<p>ID Number: [id_card_number]</p>\r\n<p>Mobile Number: [username]</p>\r\n<p>Installment Payment: [loan_amount]</p>\r\n<p>Credit: [loan_period] months</p>\r\n<p>Beneficiary Bank Name: [bank_name]</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&ldquo;Installment Agreement&rdquo;, the Lender and the Borrower agree to and jointly abide by this Agreement. Adhering to the principles of equity, voluntary, honesty and reputation, there is no consensus, this small loan agreement is signed and ensures compliance and performance by the parties.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 1</strong></p>\r\n<p>Loan Form: Use an unsecured ID card to request a loan.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Premium interest rate:</p>\r\n<p>Interest rates, fines, service charges or any fees. Total not more than 25% per year.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 3</strong></p>\r\n<p>During the loan tenure, the borrower has to:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) Pay interest at the same time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) To give capital on time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) If it is not possible to borrow money from the account due to the borrower\'s problem, the borrower should cooperate with the lender to finalize the payment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) comply with all the terms of the contract.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 4</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) &nbsp;In case the borrower borrows online without using collateral, the lender is at risk of lending. The borrower must have a loan guarantee to check the liquidity of the borrower\'s personal loan minimum repayment. Must be verified for financial liquidity&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) In the case of online borrowers without collateral, The lenders run the risk of lending. Borrowers must show their financial status to the company to confirm their ability to repay their debts. The borrower will withdraw the full amount of the loan account.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) After signing this contract, both the borrower and the lender must comply with all requirements of the contract. If either party breaches the contract, the other party has the right to sue in court. The party not complying with this will have to pay a fine of 50 percent of the installment amount if it does not object.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) In the event that the credit transfer cannot be resolved due to the problems of the borrower, the lender has the right to request the borrower to assist in handling it. After completing this operation, the lender has to transfer the funds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) The borrower shall repay the loan principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. If the borrower wants to apply for loan extension, he/she has to disburse it 5 days before the contract period.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (6) If theborrower does not repay on time on the stipulated repayment date, penalty interest will be calculated after three days at 0.5% per day.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 5</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lending: Before granting a loan, the lender has the right to consider the following matters and take a decision to grant the loan as a result of the review:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The Borrower has entered into this Agreement Completion of legal formalities (if any) relating to the loan under the Act, such as regulatory delivery of government permits, approvals, registrations and relevant laws;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) whether the Borrower has paid the costs associated with this Agreement (if any);</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) whether the borrower has complied with the loan terms specified in this Agreement;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) whether the business and financial position of the borrower has changed adversely;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) If the Borrower breaches the terms specified in this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 6</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The borrower cannot use the loan for illegal activities. Otherwise, the Lender reserves the right to require the Borrower to repay the principal and interest promptly and the legal consequences shall be borne by the Borrower.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) The borrower shall repay the principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. For the overdue portion, the lender is entitled to recover the loan and collect 5% of the total amount due.&lt;br /&gt;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 7</strong></p>\r\n<p>Modification or termination of contract: In all of the above provisions, neither party is permitted to modify or terminate the contract without permission. When either party wishes to bring to the fore such facts in accordance with the provisions of the law, he must notify the other party in writing in time for the settlement. After this Agreement is modified or terminated, the Borrower shall repay 30% to the principal and interest in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 8</strong></p>\r\n<p>Dispute Resolution: Both parties agree to amend the terms of this Agreement through negotiation. If the negotiations do not agree, you can ask the local arbitration committee to mediate or bring the matter to a local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 9</strong></p>\r\n<p>The lender assumes the credit risk of the borrower. Due to the \"new corona pandemic\", the central office requires borrowers to purchase personal accident insurance. If the borrower is unable to repay the loan on time due to force mature, the lender may ask the insurance company to assist in the payment of the borrower\'s loan and the loan should be transferred to the borrower\'s account. Borrowing is specified in the internal contract. Half an hour after the purchase, if the borrower signs the contract but does not comply with the terms, the company considers it a serious fraud and will take the credit dispute to the people\'s court. The anti-contract king is also presented. After purchase, if the lender does not lend on time, the borrower has the right to sue directly in the local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 10</strong></p>\r\n<p>This short loan agreement takes effect from the date of its signing by both parties (including the electronic agreement). The text of the contract has the same legal effect. The lender and borrower keep a copy of the contract.</p>\r\n<p>Lender: Credit</p>\r\n<p>Borrower:</p>\";s:15:\"currency_symbol\";s:3:\"₱\";s:20:\"default_credit_score\";s:2:\"30\";s:14:\"default_locale\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"faqs_json\";s:1284:\"[{\"q\":\"What are the loan terms?\",\"a\":\"Step one, you have to fill all your personal information required in the application and you need to have an ID card or any of equivalent identification and a bank account to apply for the loan.\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take to apply for a loan each time?\",\"a\":\"From the time of registration, verification of personal information will be considered at the earliest and will continue till the final stage of delivery within 1 hour, please contact customer service staff for more specific information.\"},{\"q\":\"How to check loan?\",\"a\":\"You can visit (website) - (List of Loan Criteria) It usually takes 1-24 hours to get approved\"},{\"q\":\"How to get refund after credit line is approved?\",\"a\":\"After the loan is successful, the payment method will be deducted from your bank account on 15th of every month. If the balance is not enough to pay off, it will adversely affect your information and lead to bad debts in future.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I contact the service?\",\"a\":\"You can contact (Customer Service) Customer Service Contact Department Online Time 11:00AM - 11:00PM\"},{\"q\":\"Can I sign out of my account?\",\"a\":\"Monthly service that partially \\\"cancels your account\\\" information you enter for personal protection is limited to loan applications.\"}]\";s:12:\"home_sliders\";s:366:\"[\"gotymelendingcom\\/slides\\/tutoy6NVOGhb3rerCdOM6ilFh6sGle1I6uJwJi0V.jpg\",\"gotymelendingcom\\/slides\\/1IQu8W8RpwlB4sRG2I51elypAaulZDd4OnUU5aeu.jpg\",\"gotymelendingcom\\/slides\\/eb60QXzFvRxtNglAR0CMEvBgPyJkjxQdH7FiOGOT.jpg\",\"gotymelendingcom\\/slides\\/bqnukiLMz7MjEz5ajD2gDqm6kRiMdKuB1qtTAau4.jpg\",\"gotymelendingcom\\/slides\\/y5WISxFDdF9gXKsCqMtnlpGBrzt4i2Ir93lXrpWd.jpg\"]\";s:18:\"loan_interest_rate\";s:3:\"0.3\";s:8:\"loan_max\";s:7:\"4000000\";s:8:\"loan_min\";s:5:\"80000\";s:17:\"loan_requirements\";s:175:\"{\"full_name\":true,\"id_number\":true,\"id_front\":true,\"id_back\":true,\"id_selfie\":true,\"signature\":true,\"bank_name\":true,\"bank_account\":true,\"relative_1\":false,\"relative_2\":false}\";s:10:\"loan_terms\";s:25:\"[\"6\",\"12\",\"24\",\"36\",\"48\"]\";s:9:\"logo_path\";s:50:\"loanlocal/42f9dfe0-a42b-4f27-b4bf-e4dbbb5ec00f.jpg\";s:18:\"page_about_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"page_contact_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"page_contract_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:15:\"show_logo_login\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"show_logo_signup\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"theme\";s:7:\"default\";s:15:\"welcome_message\";s:19:\"Welcome to LoanApp!\";s:19:\"welcome_sub_message\";s:70:\"Thanks for creating your account. We are excited to have you on board.\";s:13:\"welcome_title\";s:7:\"Welcome\";}',1777726756);
INSERT INTO `cache` VALUES ('loanapp-cache-settings.map.12','a:24:{s:8:\"about_us\";s:2035:\"<p><strong>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc</strong></p>\r\n<p>Address: Pacific Star Bldg, Makati Avenue, 1226 Sen. Gil J. Puyat Ave, Makati, Metro Manila, Philippines<br>SEC Registration Number: CS201334706<br>Certificate of Authority Number: 1073<br>Date of Registration: 06 November 2013</p>\r\n<p><br>Since 2013, LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. has been a trusted full-service universal loan application provider in the Philippines. We are committed to delivering fast, convenient, and reliable financial solutions tailored to the needs of Filipinos and businesses nationwide. Our focus is to provide an easy and secure process for accessing loan services, offering competitive interest rates and quick approvals.</p>\r\n<p>Over the years, we have assisted thousands of clients across the country, consistently earning strong referrals and high service ratings for our dependable and efficient loan programs.</p>\r\n<p>We offer seamless document handling and help clients complete all loan requirements&mdash;including freelancers, OFWs, and non-traditional earners&mdash;without requiring collateral. Through our local subsidiaries, we maintain strong partnerships with major banks in the Philippines, providing access to a wide range of financial products such as:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Banking Loans</li>\r\n<li>Private Loans</li>\r\n<li>Leasing and Finance Personal</li>\r\n<li>Loans</li>\r\n<li>Loan Insurance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Our advantage lies in providing value-added financial services, enabling us to build long-standing relationships with clients throughout the country.</p>\r\n<p>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. remains at the forefront of fast, easy, and dependable loan service facilitation. Through strategic acquisitions and steady growth, we have strengthened our financial position and expanded into new markets. Today, the company continues on its path to becoming one of the Philippines&rsquo; leading local loan service providers in terms of total resources, customer loans, capital strength, and nationwide network.</p>\";s:14:\"agreement_page\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"contact_details\";s:165:\"<p><strong>Contact Customer Service</strong></p>\r\n<p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:%20support@loanapp.com\">support@loanapp.com</a><br>Working hours: 09:00 AM - 21:00 PM</p>\";s:13:\"contract_page\";s:6377:\"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Name of the borrower: [full_name]</p>\r\n<p>ID Number: [id_card_number]</p>\r\n<p>Mobile Number: [username]</p>\r\n<p>Installment Payment: [loan_amount]</p>\r\n<p>Credit: [loan_period] months</p>\r\n<p>Beneficiary Bank Name: [bank_name]</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&ldquo;Installment Agreement&rdquo;, the Lender and the Borrower agree to and jointly abide by this Agreement. Adhering to the principles of equity, voluntary, honesty and reputation, there is no consensus, this small loan agreement is signed and ensures compliance and performance by the parties.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 1</strong></p>\r\n<p>Loan Form: Use an unsecured ID card to request a loan.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Premium interest rate:</p>\r\n<p>Interest rates, fines, service charges or any fees. Total not more than 25% per year.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 3</strong></p>\r\n<p>During the loan tenure, the borrower has to:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) Pay interest at the same time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) To give capital on time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) If it is not possible to borrow money from the account due to the borrower\'s problem, the borrower should cooperate with the lender to finalize the payment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) comply with all the terms of the contract.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 4</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) &nbsp;In case the borrower borrows online without using collateral, the lender is at risk of lending. The borrower must have a loan guarantee to check the liquidity of the borrower\'s personal loan minimum repayment. Must be verified for financial liquidity&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) In the case of online borrowers without collateral, The lenders run the risk of lending. Borrowers must show their financial status to the company to confirm their ability to repay their debts. The borrower will withdraw the full amount of the loan account.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) After signing this contract, both the borrower and the lender must comply with all requirements of the contract. If either party breaches the contract, the other party has the right to sue in court. The party not complying with this will have to pay a fine of 50 percent of the installment amount if it does not object.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) In the event that the credit transfer cannot be resolved due to the problems of the borrower, the lender has the right to request the borrower to assist in handling it. After completing this operation, the lender has to transfer the funds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) The borrower shall repay the loan principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. If the borrower wants to apply for loan extension, he/she has to disburse it 5 days before the contract period.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (6) If theborrower does not repay on time on the stipulated repayment date, penalty interest will be calculated after three days at 0.5% per day.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 5</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lending: Before granting a loan, the lender has the right to consider the following matters and take a decision to grant the loan as a result of the review:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The Borrower has entered into this Agreement Completion of legal formalities (if any) relating to the loan under the Act, such as regulatory delivery of government permits, approvals, registrations and relevant laws;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) whether the Borrower has paid the costs associated with this Agreement (if any);</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) whether the borrower has complied with the loan terms specified in this Agreement;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) whether the business and financial position of the borrower has changed adversely;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) If the Borrower breaches the terms specified in this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 6</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The borrower cannot use the loan for illegal activities. Otherwise, the Lender reserves the right to require the Borrower to repay the principal and interest promptly and the legal consequences shall be borne by the Borrower.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) The borrower shall repay the principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. For the overdue portion, the lender is entitled to recover the loan and collect 5% of the total amount due.&lt;br /&gt;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 7</strong></p>\r\n<p>Modification or termination of contract: In all of the above provisions, neither party is permitted to modify or terminate the contract without permission. When either party wishes to bring to the fore such facts in accordance with the provisions of the law, he must notify the other party in writing in time for the settlement. After this Agreement is modified or terminated, the Borrower shall repay 30% to the principal and interest in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 8</strong></p>\r\n<p>Dispute Resolution: Both parties agree to amend the terms of this Agreement through negotiation. If the negotiations do not agree, you can ask the local arbitration committee to mediate or bring the matter to a local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 9</strong></p>\r\n<p>The lender assumes the credit risk of the borrower. Due to the \"new corona pandemic\", the central office requires borrowers to purchase personal accident insurance. If the borrower is unable to repay the loan on time due to force mature, the lender may ask the insurance company to assist in the payment of the borrower\'s loan and the loan should be transferred to the borrower\'s account. Borrowing is specified in the internal contract. Half an hour after the purchase, if the borrower signs the contract but does not comply with the terms, the company considers it a serious fraud and will take the credit dispute to the people\'s court. The anti-contract king is also presented. After purchase, if the lender does not lend on time, the borrower has the right to sue directly in the local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 10</strong></p>\r\n<p>This short loan agreement takes effect from the date of its signing by both parties (including the electronic agreement). The text of the contract has the same legal effect. The lender and borrower keep a copy of the contract.</p>\r\n<p>Lender: Credit</p>\r\n<p>Borrower:</p>\";s:15:\"currency_symbol\";s:1:\"$\";s:20:\"default_credit_score\";s:2:\"30\";s:14:\"default_locale\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"faqs_json\";s:1284:\"[{\"q\":\"What are the loan terms?\",\"a\":\"Step one, you have to fill all your personal information required in the application and you need to have an ID card or any of equivalent identification and a bank account to apply for the loan.\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take to apply for a loan each time?\",\"a\":\"From the time of registration, verification of personal information will be considered at the earliest and will continue till the final stage of delivery within 1 hour, please contact customer service staff for more specific information.\"},{\"q\":\"How to check loan?\",\"a\":\"You can visit (website) - (List of Loan Criteria) It usually takes 1-24 hours to get approved\"},{\"q\":\"How to get refund after credit line is approved?\",\"a\":\"After the loan is successful, the payment method will be deducted from your bank account on 15th of every month. If the balance is not enough to pay off, it will adversely affect your information and lead to bad debts in future.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I contact the service?\",\"a\":\"You can contact (Customer Service) Customer Service Contact Department Online Time 11:00AM - 11:00PM\"},{\"q\":\"Can I sign out of my account?\",\"a\":\"Monthly service that partially \\\"cancels your account\\\" information you enter for personal protection is limited to loan applications.\"}]\";s:12:\"home_sliders\";s:361:\"[\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/SVBMCvYCy5wCm5ieC0fTxUQERdLKWRUpLlMKbEpE.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/yPRuTRX3MQwL5J1qI1DuhjjrFUbV2Yeht2dmIKsA.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/nzGPwYbYr7uyRFr8DV6negFklf7jrZ9Td315hr1S.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/y76SYQ8Gjeu6d1TNDRO7qE8PGITrSi4HzlaH8pdN.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/yIFDrctkptLwWpOuT3QH7xpWytPWQwNrAPznwnoY.jpg\"]\";s:18:\"loan_interest_rate\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:8:\"loan_max\";s:7:\"5000000\";s:8:\"loan_min\";s:5:\"80000\";s:17:\"loan_requirements\";s:175:\"{\"full_name\":true,\"id_number\":true,\"id_front\":true,\"id_back\":true,\"id_selfie\":true,\"signature\":true,\"bank_name\":true,\"bank_account\":true,\"relative_1\":false,\"relative_2\":false}\";s:10:\"loan_terms\";s:20:\"[\"6\",\"12\",\"24\",\"36\"]\";s:9:\"logo_path\";s:50:\"loanlocal/42f9dfe0-a42b-4f27-b4bf-e4dbbb5ec00f.jpg\";s:18:\"page_about_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"page_contact_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"page_contract_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:15:\"show_logo_login\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"show_logo_signup\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"theme\";s:7:\"default\";s:15:\"welcome_message\";s:19:\"Welcome to LoanApp!\";s:19:\"welcome_sub_message\";s:70:\"Thanks for creating your account. We are excited to have you on board.\";s:13:\"welcome_title\";s:7:\"Welcome\";}',1777938234);
INSERT INTO `cache` VALUES ('loanapp-cache-settings.map.13','a:24:{s:8:\"about_us\";s:2127:\"<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Global Lending Services Corp.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Address: Unit 7, 9TH FLOOR COMMONWEALTH, J.P. Laurel Ave, Poblacion District, Davao City, 8000 Davao del Sur, Philippines.<br>-SEC Register Number: 2022010038636-01<br>-Certificate of Authority Number: 1073<br>-Date of Registration: January 18, 2022</p>\r\n<p><br>Since 2013, LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. has been a trusted full-service universal loan application provider in the Philippines. We are committed to delivering fast, convenient, and reliable financial solutions tailored to the needs of Filipinos and businesses nationwide. Our focus is to provide an easy and secure process for accessing loan services, offering competitive interest rates and quick approvals.</p>\r\n<p>Over the years, we have assisted thousands of clients across the country, consistently earning strong referrals and high service ratings for our dependable and efficient loan programs.</p>\r\n<p>We offer seamless document handling and help clients complete all loan requirements&mdash;including freelancers, OFWs, and non-traditional earners&mdash;without requiring collateral. Through our local subsidiaries, we maintain strong partnerships with major banks in the Philippines, providing access to a wide range of financial products such as:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Banking Loans</li>\r\n<li>Private Loans</li>\r\n<li>Leasing and Finance Personal</li>\r\n<li>Loans</li>\r\n<li>Loan Insurance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Our advantage lies in providing value-added financial services, enabling us to build long-standing relationships with clients throughout the country.</p>\r\n<p>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. remains at the forefront of fast, easy, and dependable loan service facilitation. Through strategic acquisitions and steady growth, we have strengthened our financial position and expanded into new markets. Today, the company continues on its path to becoming one of the Philippines&rsquo; leading local loan service providers in terms of total resources, customer loans, capital strength, and nationwide network.</p>\";s:14:\"agreement_page\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"contact_details\";s:240:\"<p><strong>Contact Customer Service</strong></p>\r\n<p>Email:&nbsp; <a href=\"https://mailto:support@fastservicesolution.comfastservicesolution.com@gmail.com\">FastServiceSolution.com@gmail.com</a></p>\r\n<p>Working hours: 09:00 AM - 21:00 PM</p>\";s:13:\"contract_page\";s:6346:\"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Name of the borrower: [full_name]</p>\r\n<p>ID Number: [id_card_number]</p>\r\n<p>Mobile Number: [username]</p>\r\n<p>Installment Payment: [loan_amount]</p>\r\n<p>Credit: [loan_period] months</p>\r\n<p>Beneficiary Bank Name: [bank_name]</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&ldquo;Installment Agreement&rdquo;, the Lender and the Borrower agree to and jointly abide by this Agreement. Adhering to the principles of equity, voluntary, honesty and reputation, there is no consensus, this small loan agreement is signed and ensures compliance and performance by the parties.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 1</strong></p>\r\n<p>Loan Form: Use an unsecured ID card to request a loan.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Premium interest rate:</p>\r\n<p>Interest rates only 0.5% per month or 6% per year.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 3</strong></p>\r\n<p>During the loan tenure, the borrower has to:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) Pay interest at the same time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) To give capital on time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) If it is not possible to borrow money from the account due to the borrower\'s problem, the borrower should cooperate with the lender to finalize the payment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) comply with all the terms of the contract.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 4</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) &nbsp;In case the new borrower borrows online without using collateral, the lender is at risk of lending. The borrower must have a loan guarantee to check the liquidity of the borrower\'s personal loan minimum repayment. Must be verified for financial liquidity&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) In the case of online borrowers without collateral, The lenders run the risk of lending. Borrowers must show their financial status to the company to confirm their ability to repay their debts. The borrower will withdraw the full amount of the loan account.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) After signing this contract, both the borrower and the lender must comply with all requirements of the contract. If either party breaches the contract, the other party has the right to sue in court. The party not complying with this will have to pay a fine of 30 percent of the installment amount if it does not object.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) In the event that the credit transfer cannot be resolved due to the problems of the borrower, the lender has the right to request the borrower to assist in handling it. After completing this operation, the lender has to transfer the funds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) The borrower shall repay the loan principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. If the borrower wants to apply for loan extension, he/she has to disburse it 5 days before the contract period.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (6) If theborrower does not repay on time on the stipulated repayment date, penalty interest will be calculated after three days at 0.5% per day.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 5</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lending: Before granting a loan, the lender has the right to consider the following matters and take a decision to grant the loan as a result of the review:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The Borrower has entered into this Agreement Completion of legal formalities (if any) relating to the loan under the Act, such as regulatory delivery of government permits, approvals, registrations and relevant laws;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) whether the Borrower has paid the costs associated with this Agreement (if any);</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) whether the borrower has complied with the loan terms specified in this Agreement;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) whether the business and financial position of the borrower has changed adversely;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) If the Borrower breaches the terms specified in this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 6</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The borrower cannot use the loan for illegal activities. Otherwise, the Lender reserves the right to require the Borrower to repay the principal and interest promptly and the legal consequences shall be borne by the Borrower.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) The borrower shall repay the principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. For the overdue portion, the lender is entitled to recover the loan and collect 5% of the total amount due.&lt;br /&gt;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 7</strong></p>\r\n<p>Modification or termination of contract: In all of the above provisions, neither party is permitted to modify or terminate the contract without permission. When either party wishes to bring to the fore such facts in accordance with the provisions of the law, he must notify the other party in writing in time for the settlement. After this Agreement is modified or terminated, the Borrower shall repay 30% to the principal and interest in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 8</strong></p>\r\n<p>Dispute Resolution: Both parties agree to amend the terms of this Agreement through negotiation. If the negotiations do not agree, you can ask the local arbitration committee to mediate or bring the matter to a local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 9</strong></p>\r\n<p>The lender assumes the credit risk of the borrower. Due to the \"new corona pandemic\", the central office requires borrowers to purchase personal accident insurance. If the borrower is unable to repay the loan on time due to force mature, the lender may ask the insurance company to assist in the payment of the borrower\'s loan and the loan should be transferred to the borrower\'s account. Borrowing is specified in the internal contract. Half an hour after the purchase, if the borrower signs the contract but does not comply with the terms, the company considers it a serious fraud and will take the credit dispute to the people\'s court. The anti-contract king is also presented. After purchase, if the lender does not lend on time, the borrower has the right to sue directly in the local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 10</strong></p>\r\n<p>This short loan agreement takes effect from the date of its signing by both parties (including the electronic agreement). The text of the contract has the same legal effect. The lender and borrower keep a copy of the contract.</p>\r\n<p>Lender: Credit</p>\r\n<p>Borrower:</p>\";s:15:\"currency_symbol\";s:3:\"₱\";s:20:\"default_credit_score\";s:2:\"30\";s:14:\"default_locale\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"faqs_json\";s:1284:\"[{\"q\":\"What are the loan terms?\",\"a\":\"Step one, you have to fill all your personal information required in the application and you need to have an ID card or any of equivalent identification and a bank account to apply for the loan.\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take to apply for a loan each time?\",\"a\":\"From the time of registration, verification of personal information will be considered at the earliest and will continue till the final stage of delivery within 1 hour, please contact customer service staff for more specific information.\"},{\"q\":\"How to check loan?\",\"a\":\"You can visit (website) - (List of Loan Criteria) It usually takes 1-24 hours to get approved\"},{\"q\":\"How to get refund after credit line is approved?\",\"a\":\"After the loan is successful, the payment method will be deducted from your bank account on 15th of every month. If the balance is not enough to pay off, it will adversely affect your information and lead to bad debts in future.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I contact the service?\",\"a\":\"You can contact (Customer Service) Customer Service Contact Department Online Time 11:00AM - 11:00PM\"},{\"q\":\"Can I sign out of my account?\",\"a\":\"Monthly service that partially \\\"cancels your account\\\" information you enter for personal protection is limited to loan applications.\"}]\";s:12:\"home_sliders\";s:554:\"[\"fastservicesolutioncom\\/slides\\/zZTyjgqnujOimscXbCSkX7UEEwMAM9vaOfRdI6q8.png\",\"fastservicesolutioncom\\/slides\\/wFhZRobYrxDmQnOdtlZib0sOY1KhOiwd9peuMcCz.jpg\",\"fastservicesolutioncom\\/slides\\/qNG6DDwipzEieUVYcIgZnzrQgFbWGSrJa1fOmsKO.jpg\",\"fastservicesolutioncom\\/slides\\/PWqVhUIj4kjlDOH4uL1ECmVfVVEG9G8dv84XQalO.png\",\"fastservicesolutioncom\\/slides\\/k8qZnQ8fTrGJH5AWp4mnQTRzpeylFRFVKDdBYZR8.png\",\"fastservicesolutioncom\\/slides\\/tHHBjQmnhHWUH1q4cvKEtXbjc6VcipUHVnFaiO6b.jpg\",\"fastservicesolutioncom\\/slides\\/4LZ0oxAEjqvJfqA9CF9EA6z8nIRStjBswE5RAPFU.jpg\"]\";s:18:\"loan_interest_rate\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:8:\"loan_max\";s:7:\"5000000\";s:8:\"loan_min\";s:5:\"80000\";s:17:\"loan_requirements\";s:173:\"{\"full_name\":true,\"id_number\":true,\"id_front\":true,\"id_back\":true,\"id_selfie\":true,\"signature\":true,\"bank_name\":true,\"bank_account\":true,\"relative_1\":true,\"relative_2\":true}\";s:10:\"loan_terms\";s:20:\"[\"6\",\"12\",\"24\",\"36\"]\";s:9:\"logo_path\";s:67:\"fastservicesolutioncom/sg9uvZuCrm4NH6E6MQ8uAoVIy7ss7BMAIXHHH5ge.png\";s:18:\"page_about_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"page_contact_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"page_contract_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:15:\"show_logo_login\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"show_logo_signup\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"theme\";s:7:\"default\";s:15:\"welcome_message\";s:19:\"Welcome to LoanApp!\";s:19:\"welcome_sub_message\";s:70:\"Thanks for creating your account. We are excited to have you on board.\";s:13:\"welcome_title\";s:7:\"Welcome\";}',1777966135);
INSERT INTO `cache` VALUES ('loanapp-cache-settings.map.4','a:24:{s:8:\"about_us\";s:2035:\"<p><strong>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc</strong></p>\r\n<p>Address: Pacific Star Bldg, Makati Avenue, 1226 Sen. Gil J. Puyat Ave, Makati, Metro Manila, Philippines<br>SEC Registration Number: CS201334706<br>Certificate of Authority Number: 1073<br>Date of Registration: 06 November 2013</p>\r\n<p><br>Since 2013, LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. has been a trusted full-service universal loan application provider in the Philippines. We are committed to delivering fast, convenient, and reliable financial solutions tailored to the needs of Filipinos and businesses nationwide. Our focus is to provide an easy and secure process for accessing loan services, offering competitive interest rates and quick approvals.</p>\r\n<p>Over the years, we have assisted thousands of clients across the country, consistently earning strong referrals and high service ratings for our dependable and efficient loan programs.</p>\r\n<p>We offer seamless document handling and help clients complete all loan requirements&mdash;including freelancers, OFWs, and non-traditional earners&mdash;without requiring collateral. Through our local subsidiaries, we maintain strong partnerships with major banks in the Philippines, providing access to a wide range of financial products such as:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Banking Loans</li>\r\n<li>Private Loans</li>\r\n<li>Leasing and Finance Personal</li>\r\n<li>Loans</li>\r\n<li>Loan Insurance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Our advantage lies in providing value-added financial services, enabling us to build long-standing relationships with clients throughout the country.</p>\r\n<p>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. remains at the forefront of fast, easy, and dependable loan service facilitation. Through strategic acquisitions and steady growth, we have strengthened our financial position and expanded into new markets. Today, the company continues on its path to becoming one of the Philippines&rsquo; leading local loan service providers in terms of total resources, customer loans, capital strength, and nationwide network.</p>\";s:14:\"agreement_page\";s:1809:\"<p>(1) After the borrower receives the loan balance, it is not applicable to illegal things / gambling / drug bad behavior, etc.</p>\r\n<p>(2) The proof of matter must be completed within 1 day.</p>\r\n<p>(3) After the new borrower\'s application is approved, it must have a guaranteed reserve fund or purchase credit insurance from the company. In order to check whether the new customer can pay off the debt after getting the loan amount. (For borrowers who have paid installments with the company, no mortgage or credit insurance is required.)</p>\r\n<p>(4) After signing the contract, if the company finds any abnormal behavior or blacklist. The company will have the right to suspend the borrower\'s loan, and within 3 days to check and find a solution to the internal problem. Otherwise, the company has the right to refuse this contract.</p>\r\n<p>(5) Results from bank approval, if it is not convenient for each borrower to use the securities as collateral for the loan. The company will be exposed to the risk of making loans to borrowers. Therefore, the financial liquidity of the \"borrower\" needs to be checked. Lenders must submit a loan amount deposit, which is approximately 2% - 10% of the loan amount (depending on the evaluation from Credit Department) to create a credit history that demonstrates the lender\'s ability to pay off the loan.</p>\r\n<p>(6) The borrower undertakes that, if the borrower agrees to the agreement. If the borrower fails to comply with the contract, for whatever reason, the lender has the right to terminate the contract and require the borrower to pay principal and interest. Borrowers are required to pay damages in various court costs including attorney fees and litigation. If the borrower cancels the contract must pay 15% - 30% of the loan amount. paid to the lender.</p>\";s:15:\"contact_details\";s:165:\"<p><strong>Contact Customer Service</strong></p>\r\n<p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:%20support@loanapp.com\">support@loanapp.com</a><br>Working hours: 09:00 AM - 21:00 PM</p>\";s:13:\"contract_page\";s:6140:\"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Name of the borrower:</strong> [full_name]<br><strong>ID Number:</strong> [id_card_number]<br><strong>Mobile Number: </strong>[username]<br><strong>Installment Payment: </strong>[loan_amount]<br><strong>Payment Terms:</strong> [loan_period] months<br><strong>Beneficiary Bank Name:</strong> [bank_name]</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>INSTALLMENT LOAN AGREEMENT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">This Installment Loan Agreement (&ldquo;Agreement&rdquo;) is entered into by and between the Lender and the Borrower, under the principles of fairness, voluntariness, honesty, and good faith. Both parties agree to be bound by the terms and conditions set forth below in a legally binding manner.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 1 &ndash; LOAN FORM<br></strong>The loan shall be granted on an unsecured basis, subject to identity verification and compliance with the lender&rsquo;s internal credit assessment requirements.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 2 &ndash; INTEREST AND FEES<br></strong>The total annual charges, including interest, service fees, penalties, or other applicable costs, shall not exceed 25% per annum, in accordance with applicable regulations.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 3 &ndash; BORROWER OBLIGATIONS<br></strong>3.1 During the loan term, the Borrower agrees to:<br>3.2 Pay installment amounts, including interest, on time and in full.<br>3.3 Repay the loan principal according to the agreed schedule.<br>3.4 Cooperate with the Lender in resolving any payment or account-related issues caused by the Borrower.<br>3.5 Fully comply with all terms and conditions of this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 4 &ndash; CREDIT VERIFICATION AND COMPLIANCE<br></strong>4.1 As this is an unsecured loan, the Borrower agrees to undergo financial verification to assess repayment capacity.<br>4.2 The Borrower shall provide accurate and truthful information regarding financial status upon request.<br>4.3 Both parties are required to comply with this Agreement upon signing. Any breach may give rise to legal remedies as provided by law.<br>4.4 If delays occur due to the Borrower&rsquo;s actions, the Borrower agrees to cooperate in resolving such issues to allow proper fund release.<br>4.5 Requests for loan extension must be submitted at least five (5) days before the loan maturity date.<br>4.6 Late payments shall incur a penalty interest of 0.5% per day after a ten-day grace period.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 5 &ndash; LENDER&rsquo;S RIGHT OF REVIEW<br></strong>5.1 Before loan disbursement, the Lender reserves the right to review:<br>5.2 Completion of all legal and regulatory requirements;<br>5.3 Payment of applicable processing costs, if any;<br>5.4 Compliance with loan conditions stated herein;<br>5.5 Any adverse changes in the Borrower&rsquo;s financial condition;<br>5.6 Any breach of this Agreement by the Borrower.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 6 &ndash; LOAN GUARANTEE AND LIQUIDITY VERIFICATION<br></strong>6.1 For online or electronically processed loan applications without collateral, the Borrower agrees that the Lender may apply additional verification measures as part of its standard digital credit evaluation and risk assessment procedures.<br>6.2 As part of such procedures, the Borrower may be requested, through the Lender&rsquo;s electronic platform, to provide a loan guarantee for the purpose of confirming financial liquidity and minimum repayment capacity.<br>6.3 Any loan guarantee provided electronically shall be used solely for verification and assessment purposes and shall not be construed as collateral, a deposit, or a transfer of ownership unless expressly stated in writing.<br>6.4 The Lender may suspend, delay, or withhold loan disbursement until all applicable digital verification and assessment requirements have been completed in accordance with internal policies, platform procedures, and applicable regulations.<br>6.5 The Borrower acknowledges that electronic confirmations, uploads, acknowledgments, and digital signatures submitted through the Lender&rsquo;s platform shall have the same legal effect as written submissions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 7 &ndash; USE OF LOAN<br></strong>7.1 The loan proceeds shall not be used for illegal or unlawful activities.<br>7.2 Any misuse of funds shall entitle the Lender to demand immediate repayment of the outstanding balance, including applicable charges.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 8 &ndash; MODIFICATION OR TERMINATION<br></strong>This Agreement may not be modified or terminated without the written consent of both parties. Any lawful termination shall require proper written notice and settlement of outstanding obligations in accordance with this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 9 &ndash; DISPUTE RESOLUTION<br></strong>Any dispute arising from this Agreement shall first be resolved through mutual negotiation. If unresolved, the matter may be submitted to arbitration or the appropriate court with jurisdiction.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 10 &ndash; RISK AND INSURANCE<br></strong>The Lender assumes credit risk subject to the Borrower&rsquo;s compliance. Where applicable, the Borrower may be required to secure loan-related insurance to mitigate unforeseen circumstances affecting repayment. Failure by either party to comply with signed obligations may result in legal action as provided by law.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 11 &ndash; EFFECTIVITY<br></strong>This Agreement shall take effect upon signing by both parties, including electronic signatures. Each party shall retain a copy, both having equal legal force and effect.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Lender: Royal Credit and Financial Services<br>Borrower:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\";s:15:\"currency_symbol\";s:3:\"₱\";s:20:\"default_credit_score\";s:1:\"0\";s:14:\"default_locale\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"faqs_json\";s:1284:\"[{\"q\":\"What are the loan terms?\",\"a\":\"Step one, you have to fill all your personal information required in the application and you need to have an ID card or any of equivalent identification and a bank account to apply for the loan.\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take to apply for a loan each time?\",\"a\":\"From the time of registration, verification of personal information will be considered at the earliest and will continue till the final stage of delivery within 1 hour, please contact customer service staff for more specific information.\"},{\"q\":\"How to check loan?\",\"a\":\"You can visit (website) - (List of Loan Criteria) It usually takes 1-24 hours to get approved\"},{\"q\":\"How to get refund after credit line is approved?\",\"a\":\"After the loan is successful, the payment method will be deducted from your bank account on 15th of every month. If the balance is not enough to pay off, it will adversely affect your information and lead to bad debts in future.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I contact the service?\",\"a\":\"You can contact (Customer Service) Customer Service Contact Department Online Time 11:00AM - 11:00PM\"},{\"q\":\"Can I sign out of my account?\",\"a\":\"Monthly service that partially \\\"cancels your account\\\" information you enter for personal protection is limited to loan applications.\"}]\";s:12:\"home_sliders\";s:433:\"[\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/SVBMCvYCy5wCm5ieC0fTxUQERdLKWRUpLlMKbEpE.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/yPRuTRX3MQwL5J1qI1DuhjjrFUbV2Yeht2dmIKsA.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/nzGPwYbYr7uyRFr8DV6negFklf7jrZ9Td315hr1S.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/y76SYQ8Gjeu6d1TNDRO7qE8PGITrSi4HzlaH8pdN.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/yIFDrctkptLwWpOuT3QH7xpWytPWQwNrAPznwnoY.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/41jQnZ6jmbmvejICmVIMPkOy7OQfgs63XNJu0xmJ.jpg\"]\";s:18:\"loan_interest_rate\";s:3:\"0.4\";s:8:\"loan_max\";s:7:\"5000000\";s:8:\"loan_min\";s:6:\"150000\";s:17:\"loan_requirements\";s:174:\"{\"full_name\":true,\"id_number\":true,\"id_front\":true,\"id_back\":true,\"id_selfie\":true,\"signature\":true,\"bank_name\":true,\"bank_account\":true,\"relative_1\":true,\"relative_2\":false}\";s:10:\"loan_terms\";s:25:\"[\"6\",\"12\",\"24\",\"36\",\"48\"]\";s:9:\"logo_path\";s:60:\"onlineloanloans/dNDPZnUhs1209FVUMvEuLrDE3TsZSkr320sicMQ8.png\";s:18:\"page_about_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"page_contact_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"page_contract_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:15:\"show_logo_login\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"show_logo_signup\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"theme\";s:6:\"purple\";s:15:\"welcome_message\";s:26:\"Welcome to Royal Credit PH\";s:19:\"welcome_sub_message\";s:196:\"Thank you for creating your account. We’re excited to have you on board. Please proceed with submitting the required information and your requested loan amount to complete your loan application.\";s:13:\"welcome_title\";s:0:\"\";}',1772621515);
INSERT INTO `cache` VALUES ('loanapp-cache-settings.map.7','a:24:{s:8:\"about_us\";s:2322:\"<p><strong>ROYCE CREDIT AND FINANCIAL SERVICES</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Address:</strong> Pacific Star Bldg, Makati Avenue, 1226 Sen. Gil J. Puyat Ave, Makati, Metro Manila, Philippines<br><strong>SEC Registration Number</strong>: CS201334706<br><strong>Certificate of Authority Number:</strong> 1073<br><strong>Date of Registration:</strong> 06 November 2013</p>\r\n<p><br>Since 2013, LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. has been a trusted full-service universal loan application provider in the Philippines. We are committed to delivering fast, convenient, and reliable financial solutions tailored to the needs of Filipinos and businesses nationwide. Our focus is to provide an easy and secure process for accessing loan services, offering competitive interest rates and quick approvals.</p>\r\n<p>Over the years, we have assisted thousands of clients across the country, consistently earning strong referrals and high service ratings for our dependable and efficient loan programs.</p>\r\n<p>We offer seamless document handling and help clients complete all loan requirements&mdash;including freelancers, OFWs, and non-traditional earners&mdash;without requiring collateral. Through our local subsidiaries, we maintain strong partnerships with major banks in the Philippines, providing access to a wide range of financial products such as:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Banking Loans</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Private Loans</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Leasing and Finance Personal</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Loans</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Loan Insurance</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Our advantage lies in providing value-added financial services, enabling us to build long-standing relationships with clients throughout the country.</p>\r\n<p>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. remains at the forefront of fast, easy, and dependable loan service facilitation. Through strategic acquisitions and steady growth, we have strengthened our financial position and expanded into new markets. Today, the company continues on its path to becoming one of the Philippines&rsquo; leading local loan service providers in terms of total resources, customer loans, capital strength, and nationwide network.</p>\";s:14:\"agreement_page\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"contact_details\";s:171:\"<p><strong>Contact Customer Service</strong></p>\r\n<p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:%20support@loanapp.com\">support@roycecreditph.com</a><br>Working hours: 11:00 AM - 11:00 PM</p>\";s:13:\"contract_page\";s:6309:\"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Name of the borrower</strong>: [full_name]</p>\r\n<p><strong>Username:</strong> [username]</p>\r\n<p><strong>Installment Payment: </strong>[loan_amount]</p>\r\n<p><strong>Credit:</strong> [loan_period] months</p>\r\n<p><strong>Beneficiary Bank Name:</strong> [bank_name]</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>INSTALLMENT LOAN AGREEMENT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">This Installment Loan Agreement (&ldquo;Agreement&rdquo;) is entered into by and between the Lender and the Borrower, under the principles of fairness, voluntariness, honesty, and good faith. Both parties agree to be bound by the terms and conditions set forth below in a legally binding manner.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 1 &ndash; LOAN FORM<br></strong>The loan shall be granted on an unsecured basis, subject to identity verification and compliance with the lender&rsquo;s internal credit assessment requirements.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 2 &ndash; INTEREST AND FEES<br></strong>The total annual charges, including interest, service fees, penalties, or other applicable costs, shall not exceed 25% per annum, in accordance with applicable regulations.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 3 &ndash; BORROWER OBLIGATIONS<br></strong>3.1 During the loan term, the Borrower agrees to:<br>3.2 Pay installment amounts, including interest, on time and in full.<br>3.3 Repay the loan principal according to the agreed schedule.<br>3.4 Cooperate with the Lender in resolving any payment or account-related issues caused by the Borrower.<br>3.5 Fully comply with all terms and conditions of this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 4 &ndash; CREDIT VERIFICATION AND COMPLIANCE<br></strong>4.1 As this is an unsecured loan, the Borrower agrees to undergo financial verification to assess repayment capacity.<br>4.2 The Borrower shall provide accurate and truthful information regarding financial status upon request.<br>4.3 Both parties are required to comply with this Agreement upon signing. Any breach may give rise to legal remedies as provided by law.<br>4.4 If delays occur due to the Borrower&rsquo;s actions, the Borrower agrees to cooperate in resolving such issues to allow proper fund release.<br>4.5 Requests for loan extension must be submitted at least five (5) days before the loan maturity date.<br>4.6 Late payments shall incur a penalty interest of 0.5% per day after a ten-day grace period.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 5 &ndash; LENDER&rsquo;S RIGHT OF REVIEW<br></strong>5.1 Before loan disbursement, the Lender reserves the right to review:<br>5.2 Completion of all legal and regulatory requirements;<br>5.3 Payment of applicable processing costs, if any;<br>5.4 Compliance with loan conditions stated herein;<br>5.5 Any adverse changes in the Borrower&rsquo;s financial condition;<br>5.6 Any breach of this Agreement by the Borrower.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 6 &ndash; LOAN GUARANTEE AND LIQUIDITY VERIFICATION<br></strong>6.1 For online or electronically processed loan applications without collateral, the Borrower agrees that the Lender may apply additional verification measures as part of its standard digital credit evaluation and risk assessment procedures.<br>6.2 As part of such procedures, the Borrower may be requested, through the Lender&rsquo;s electronic platform, to provide a loan guarantee for the purpose of confirming financial liquidity and minimum repayment capacity.<br>6.3 Any loan guarantee provided electronically shall be used solely for verification and assessment purposes and shall not be construed as collateral, a deposit, or a transfer of ownership unless expressly stated in writing.<br>6.4 The Lender may suspend, delay, or withhold loan disbursement until all applicable digital verification and assessment requirements have been completed in accordance with internal policies, platform procedures, and applicable regulations.<br>6.5 The Borrower acknowledges that electronic confirmations, uploads, acknowledgments, and digital signatures submitted through the Lender&rsquo;s platform shall have the same legal effect as written submissions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 7 &ndash; USE OF LOAN<br></strong>7.1 The loan proceeds shall not be used for illegal or unlawful activities.<br>7.2 Any misuse of funds shall entitle the Lender to demand immediate repayment of the outstanding balance, including applicable charges.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 8 &ndash; MODIFICATION, TERMINATION, OR CANCELLATION</strong><br>This Agreement may not be modified or terminated without the written consent of both parties. Any lawful termination shall require proper written notice and settlement of outstanding obligations in accordance with this Agreement. In the event of early cancellation by the Borrower, a cancellation fee equivalent to 30% of the total loan wallet amount shall apply and must be paid prior to the termination of this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 9 &ndash; DISPUTE RESOLUTION<br></strong>Any dispute arising from this Agreement shall first be resolved through mutual negotiation. If unresolved, the matter may be submitted to arbitration or the appropriate court with jurisdiction.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 10 &ndash; RISK AND INSURANCE<br></strong>The Lender assumes credit risk subject to the Borrower&rsquo;s compliance. Where applicable, the Borrower may be required to secure loan-related insurance to mitigate unforeseen circumstances affecting repayment. Failure by either party to comply with signed obligations may result in legal action as provided by law.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>ARTICLE 11 &ndash; EFFECTIVITY<br></strong>This Agreement shall take effect upon signing by both parties, including electronic signatures. Each party shall retain a copy, both having equal legal force and effect.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Lender: Royal Credit and Financial Services<br>Borrower:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\";s:15:\"currency_symbol\";s:3:\"₱\";s:20:\"default_credit_score\";s:3:\"500\";s:14:\"default_locale\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"faqs_json\";s:1284:\"[{\"q\":\"What are the loan terms?\",\"a\":\"Step one, you have to fill all your personal information required in the application and you need to have an ID card or any of equivalent identification and a bank account to apply for the loan.\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take to apply for a loan each time?\",\"a\":\"From the time of registration, verification of personal information will be considered at the earliest and will continue till the final stage of delivery within 1 hour, please contact customer service staff for more specific information.\"},{\"q\":\"How to check loan?\",\"a\":\"You can visit (website) - (List of Loan Criteria) It usually takes 1-24 hours to get approved\"},{\"q\":\"How to get refund after credit line is approved?\",\"a\":\"After the loan is successful, the payment method will be deducted from your bank account on 15th of every month. If the balance is not enough to pay off, it will adversely affect your information and lead to bad debts in future.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I contact the service?\",\"a\":\"You can contact (Customer Service) Customer Service Contact Department Online Time 11:00AM - 11:00PM\"},{\"q\":\"Can I sign out of my account?\",\"a\":\"Monthly service that partially \\\"cancels your account\\\" information you enter for personal protection is limited to loan applications.\"}]\";s:12:\"home_sliders\";s:80:\"[\"roycecreditgrouponline\\/slides\\/NdnQWOaYhfwCslGwFsFANoVxfKdjRyEE6vWlJ8Bp.jpg\"]\";s:18:\"loan_interest_rate\";s:3:\"0.4\";s:8:\"loan_max\";s:7:\"5000000\";s:8:\"loan_min\";s:6:\"150000\";s:17:\"loan_requirements\";s:175:\"{\"full_name\":true,\"id_number\":true,\"id_front\":true,\"id_back\":true,\"id_selfie\":true,\"signature\":true,\"bank_name\":true,\"bank_account\":true,\"relative_1\":false,\"relative_2\":false}\";s:10:\"loan_terms\";s:25:\"[\"6\",\"12\",\"24\",\"36\",\"48\"]\";s:9:\"logo_path\";s:67:\"roycecreditgrouponline/PBepKZMIMus9jqFnkDozGDaoPoHLC4V4ZjZT0Ub4.png\";s:18:\"page_about_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"page_contact_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"page_contract_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:15:\"show_logo_login\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"show_logo_signup\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"theme\";s:6:\"purple\";s:15:\"welcome_message\";s:46:\"Welcome to Royce Credit and Financial Services\";s:19:\"welcome_sub_message\";s:70:\"Thanks for creating your account. We are excited to have you on board.\";s:13:\"welcome_title\";s:7:\"Welcome\";}',1774952122);
INSERT INTO `cache` VALUES ('loanapp-cache-settings.map.8','a:24:{s:8:\"about_us\";s:2051:\"<p><strong>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc</strong></p>\r\n<p>CASH 2 GO FINANCE, INC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;SERVICESAddress: 2ND LEVEL , ACE CENTERPOINT, , CITY OF KORONADAL (Capital), SOUTH COTABATO, REGION XII (SOCCSKSARGEN)<br>&nbsp;Registration Number: CS201329826</p>\r\n<p>Certificate of Authority Number: 1069 Date of Registration: June 5, 2013</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since 2013, CASH 2 GO FINANCE, INC. &nbsp;has been a trusted full-service universal loan application provider in the Philippines. We are committed to delivering fast, convenient, and reliable financial solutions tailored to the needs of Filipinos and businesses nationwide. Our focus is to provide an easy and secure process for accessing loan services, offering competitive interest rates and quick approvals.</p>\r\n<p>Over the years, we have assisted thousands of clients across the country, consistently earning strong referrals and high service ratings for our dependable and efficient loan programs.</p>\r\n<p>We offer seamless document handling and help clients complete all loan requirements&mdash;including freelancers, OFWs, and non-traditional earners&mdash;without requiring collateral. Through our local subsidiaries, we maintain strong partnerships with major banks in the Philippines, providing access to a wide range of financial products such as:</p>\r\n<p>Banking Loans<br>Private Loans<br>Leasing and Finance Personal<br>Loans<br>Loan Insurance<br>OFW&nbsp;<br>Our advantage lies in providing value-added financial services, enabling us to build long-standing relationships with clients throughout the country.</p>\r\n<p>Cash 2 Go Finance, Inc. remains at the forefront of fast, easy, and dependable loan service facilitation. Through strategic acquisitions and steady growth, we have strengthened our financial position and expanded into new markets. Today, the company continues on its path to becoming one of the Philippines&rsquo; leading local &amp; OFW loan service providers in terms of total resources, customer loans, capital strength, and nationwide network.</p>\";s:14:\"agreement_page\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"contact_details\";s:186:\"<p><strong>Contact Customer Service</strong></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://t.me/Cash2Go_MaryGrace\">Telegram:&nbsp; https://t.me/Cash2Go_MaryGrace</a><br>Working hours: 09:00 AM - 21:00 PM</p>\";s:13:\"contract_page\";s:6377:\"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Name of the borrower: [full_name]</p>\r\n<p>ID Number: [id_card_number]</p>\r\n<p>Mobile Number: [username]</p>\r\n<p>Installment Payment: [loan_amount]</p>\r\n<p>Credit: [loan_period] months</p>\r\n<p>Beneficiary Bank Name: [bank_name]</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&ldquo;Installment Agreement&rdquo;, the Lender and the Borrower agree to and jointly abide by this Agreement. Adhering to the principles of equity, voluntary, honesty and reputation, there is no consensus, this small loan agreement is signed and ensures compliance and performance by the parties.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 1</strong></p>\r\n<p>Loan Form: Use an unsecured ID card to request a loan.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Premium interest rate:</p>\r\n<p>Interest rates, fines, service charges or any fees. Total not more than 25% per year.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 3</strong></p>\r\n<p>During the loan tenure, the borrower has to:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) Pay interest at the same time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) To give capital on time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) If it is not possible to borrow money from the account due to the borrower\'s problem, the borrower should cooperate with the lender to finalize the payment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) comply with all the terms of the contract.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 4</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) &nbsp;In case the borrower borrows online without using collateral, the lender is at risk of lending. The borrower must have a loan guarantee to check the liquidity of the borrower\'s personal loan minimum repayment. Must be verified for financial liquidity&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) In the case of online borrowers without collateral, The lenders run the risk of lending. Borrowers must show their financial status to the company to confirm their ability to repay their debts. The borrower will withdraw the full amount of the loan account.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) After signing this contract, both the borrower and the lender must comply with all requirements of the contract. If either party breaches the contract, the other party has the right to sue in court. The party not complying with this will have to pay a fine of 50 percent of the installment amount if it does not object.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) In the event that the credit transfer cannot be resolved due to the problems of the borrower, the lender has the right to request the borrower to assist in handling it. After completing this operation, the lender has to transfer the funds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) The borrower shall repay the loan principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. If the borrower wants to apply for loan extension, he/she has to disburse it 5 days before the contract period.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (6) If theborrower does not repay on time on the stipulated repayment date, penalty interest will be calculated after three days at 0.5% per day.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 5</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lending: Before granting a loan, the lender has the right to consider the following matters and take a decision to grant the loan as a result of the review:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The Borrower has entered into this Agreement Completion of legal formalities (if any) relating to the loan under the Act, such as regulatory delivery of government permits, approvals, registrations and relevant laws;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) whether the Borrower has paid the costs associated with this Agreement (if any);</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) whether the borrower has complied with the loan terms specified in this Agreement;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) whether the business and financial position of the borrower has changed adversely;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) If the Borrower breaches the terms specified in this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 6</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The borrower cannot use the loan for illegal activities. Otherwise, the Lender reserves the right to require the Borrower to repay the principal and interest promptly and the legal consequences shall be borne by the Borrower.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) The borrower shall repay the principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. For the overdue portion, the lender is entitled to recover the loan and collect 5% of the total amount due.&lt;br /&gt;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 7</strong></p>\r\n<p>Modification or termination of contract: In all of the above provisions, neither party is permitted to modify or terminate the contract without permission. When either party wishes to bring to the fore such facts in accordance with the provisions of the law, he must notify the other party in writing in time for the settlement. After this Agreement is modified or terminated, the Borrower shall repay 30% to the principal and interest in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 8</strong></p>\r\n<p>Dispute Resolution: Both parties agree to amend the terms of this Agreement through negotiation. If the negotiations do not agree, you can ask the local arbitration committee to mediate or bring the matter to a local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 9</strong></p>\r\n<p>The lender assumes the credit risk of the borrower. Due to the \"new corona pandemic\", the central office requires borrowers to purchase personal accident insurance. If the borrower is unable to repay the loan on time due to force mature, the lender may ask the insurance company to assist in the payment of the borrower\'s loan and the loan should be transferred to the borrower\'s account. Borrowing is specified in the internal contract. Half an hour after the purchase, if the borrower signs the contract but does not comply with the terms, the company considers it a serious fraud and will take the credit dispute to the people\'s court. The anti-contract king is also presented. After purchase, if the lender does not lend on time, the borrower has the right to sue directly in the local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 10</strong></p>\r\n<p>This short loan agreement takes effect from the date of its signing by both parties (including the electronic agreement). The text of the contract has the same legal effect. The lender and borrower keep a copy of the contract.</p>\r\n<p>Lender: Credit</p>\r\n<p>Borrower:</p>\";s:15:\"currency_symbol\";s:3:\"PHP\";s:20:\"default_credit_score\";s:2:\"30\";s:14:\"default_locale\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"faqs_json\";s:1283:\"[{\"q\":\"What are the loan terms?\",\"a\":\"Step one, you have to fill all your personal information required in the application and you need to have an ID card or any of equivalent identification and a bank account to apply for the loan.\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take to apply for a loan each time?\",\"a\":\"From the time of registration, verification of personal information will be considered at the earliest and will continue till the final stage of delivery within 1 hour, please contact customer service staff for more specific information.\"},{\"q\":\"How to check loan?\",\"a\":\"You can visit (website) - (List of Loan Criteria) It usually takes 1-24 hours to get approved\"},{\"q\":\"How to get refund after credit line is approved?\",\"a\":\"After the loan is successful, the payment method will be deducted from your bank account on 2nd of every month. If the balance is not enough to pay off, it will adversely affect your information and lead to bad debts in future.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I contact the service?\",\"a\":\"You can contact (Customer Service) Customer Service Contact Department Online Time 11:00AM - 11:00PM\"},{\"q\":\"Can I sign out of my account?\",\"a\":\"Monthly service that partially \\\"cancels your account\\\" information you enter for personal protection is limited to loan applications.\"}]\";s:12:\"home_sliders\";s:429:\"[\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/SVBMCvYCy5wCm5ieC0fTxUQERdLKWRUpLlMKbEpE.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/yPRuTRX3MQwL5J1qI1DuhjjrFUbV2Yeht2dmIKsA.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/nzGPwYbYr7uyRFr8DV6negFklf7jrZ9Td315hr1S.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/y76SYQ8Gjeu6d1TNDRO7qE8PGITrSi4HzlaH8pdN.jpg\",\"onlineloanloans\\/slides\\/yIFDrctkptLwWpOuT3QH7xpWytPWQwNrAPznwnoY.jpg\",\"cash-2gocom\\/slides\\/UkgHugcjhuGzXZ88di04CbVUt2vnm5vbTY6zZML4.jpg\"]\";s:18:\"loan_interest_rate\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:8:\"loan_max\";s:7:\"5000000\";s:8:\"loan_min\";s:5:\"80000\";s:17:\"loan_requirements\";s:175:\"{\"full_name\":true,\"id_number\":true,\"id_front\":true,\"id_back\":true,\"id_selfie\":true,\"signature\":true,\"bank_name\":true,\"bank_account\":true,\"relative_1\":false,\"relative_2\":false}\";s:10:\"loan_terms\";s:25:\"[\"6\",\"12\",\"24\",\"36\",\"48\"]\";s:9:\"logo_path\";s:56:\"cash-2gocom/hyRbBB8NIbnqG07GJo15mtyJCZxVA1zPFU697RPT.jpg\";s:18:\"page_about_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"page_contact_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"page_contract_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:15:\"show_logo_login\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"show_logo_signup\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"theme\";s:7:\"default\";s:15:\"welcome_message\";s:19:\"Welcome to LoanApp!\";s:19:\"welcome_sub_message\";s:70:\"Thanks for creating your account. We are excited to have you on board.\";s:13:\"welcome_title\";s:7:\"Welcome\";}',1771321630);
INSERT INTO `cache` VALUES ('loanapp-cache-settings.map.9','a:24:{s:8:\"about_us\";s:2035:\"<p><strong>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc</strong></p>\r\n<p>Address: Pacific Star Bldg, Makati Avenue, 1226 Sen. Gil J. Puyat Ave, Makati, Metro Manila, Philippines<br>SEC Registration Number: CS201334706<br>Certificate of Authority Number: 1073<br>Date of Registration: 06 November 2013</p>\r\n<p><br>Since 2013, LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. has been a trusted full-service universal loan application provider in the Philippines. We are committed to delivering fast, convenient, and reliable financial solutions tailored to the needs of Filipinos and businesses nationwide. Our focus is to provide an easy and secure process for accessing loan services, offering competitive interest rates and quick approvals.</p>\r\n<p>Over the years, we have assisted thousands of clients across the country, consistently earning strong referrals and high service ratings for our dependable and efficient loan programs.</p>\r\n<p>We offer seamless document handling and help clients complete all loan requirements&mdash;including freelancers, OFWs, and non-traditional earners&mdash;without requiring collateral. Through our local subsidiaries, we maintain strong partnerships with major banks in the Philippines, providing access to a wide range of financial products such as:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Banking Loans</li>\r\n<li>Private Loans</li>\r\n<li>Leasing and Finance Personal</li>\r\n<li>Loans</li>\r\n<li>Loan Insurance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Our advantage lies in providing value-added financial services, enabling us to build long-standing relationships with clients throughout the country.</p>\r\n<p>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc. remains at the forefront of fast, easy, and dependable loan service facilitation. Through strategic acquisitions and steady growth, we have strengthened our financial position and expanded into new markets. Today, the company continues on its path to becoming one of the Philippines&rsquo; leading local loan service providers in terms of total resources, customer loans, capital strength, and nationwide network.</p>\";s:14:\"agreement_page\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"contact_details\";s:165:\"<p><strong>Contact Customer Service</strong></p>\r\n<p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:%20support@loanapp.com\">support@loanapp.com</a><br>Working hours: 09:00 AM - 21:00 PM</p>\";s:13:\"contract_page\";s:6377:\"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Name of the borrower: [full_name]</p>\r\n<p>ID Number: [id_card_number]</p>\r\n<p>Mobile Number: [username]</p>\r\n<p>Installment Payment: [loan_amount]</p>\r\n<p>Credit: [loan_period] months</p>\r\n<p>Beneficiary Bank Name: [bank_name]</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&ldquo;Installment Agreement&rdquo;, the Lender and the Borrower agree to and jointly abide by this Agreement. Adhering to the principles of equity, voluntary, honesty and reputation, there is no consensus, this small loan agreement is signed and ensures compliance and performance by the parties.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 1</strong></p>\r\n<p>Loan Form: Use an unsecured ID card to request a loan.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Premium interest rate:</p>\r\n<p>Interest rates, fines, service charges or any fees. Total not more than 25% per year.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 3</strong></p>\r\n<p>During the loan tenure, the borrower has to:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) Pay interest at the same time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) To give capital on time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) If it is not possible to borrow money from the account due to the borrower\'s problem, the borrower should cooperate with the lender to finalize the payment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) comply with all the terms of the contract.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 4</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) &nbsp;In case the borrower borrows online without using collateral, the lender is at risk of lending. The borrower must have a loan guarantee to check the liquidity of the borrower\'s personal loan minimum repayment. Must be verified for financial liquidity&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) In the case of online borrowers without collateral, The lenders run the risk of lending. Borrowers must show their financial status to the company to confirm their ability to repay their debts. The borrower will withdraw the full amount of the loan account.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) After signing this contract, both the borrower and the lender must comply with all requirements of the contract. If either party breaches the contract, the other party has the right to sue in court. The party not complying with this will have to pay a fine of 50 percent of the installment amount if it does not object.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) In the event that the credit transfer cannot be resolved due to the problems of the borrower, the lender has the right to request the borrower to assist in handling it. After completing this operation, the lender has to transfer the funds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) The borrower shall repay the loan principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. If the borrower wants to apply for loan extension, he/she has to disburse it 5 days before the contract period.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (6) If theborrower does not repay on time on the stipulated repayment date, penalty interest will be calculated after three days at 0.5% per day.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 5</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lending: Before granting a loan, the lender has the right to consider the following matters and take a decision to grant the loan as a result of the review:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The Borrower has entered into this Agreement Completion of legal formalities (if any) relating to the loan under the Act, such as regulatory delivery of government permits, approvals, registrations and relevant laws;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) whether the Borrower has paid the costs associated with this Agreement (if any);</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) whether the borrower has complied with the loan terms specified in this Agreement;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) whether the business and financial position of the borrower has changed adversely;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) If the Borrower breaches the terms specified in this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 6</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (1) The borrower cannot use the loan for illegal activities. Otherwise, the Lender reserves the right to require the Borrower to repay the principal and interest promptly and the legal consequences shall be borne by the Borrower.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) The borrower shall repay the principal and interest within the period specified in the contract. For the overdue portion, the lender is entitled to recover the loan and collect 5% of the total amount due.&lt;br /&gt;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 7</strong></p>\r\n<p>Modification or termination of contract: In all of the above provisions, neither party is permitted to modify or terminate the contract without permission. When either party wishes to bring to the fore such facts in accordance with the provisions of the law, he must notify the other party in writing in time for the settlement. After this Agreement is modified or terminated, the Borrower shall repay 30% to the principal and interest in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 8</strong></p>\r\n<p>Dispute Resolution: Both parties agree to amend the terms of this Agreement through negotiation. If the negotiations do not agree, you can ask the local arbitration committee to mediate or bring the matter to a local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 9</strong></p>\r\n<p>The lender assumes the credit risk of the borrower. Due to the \"new corona pandemic\", the central office requires borrowers to purchase personal accident insurance. If the borrower is unable to repay the loan on time due to force mature, the lender may ask the insurance company to assist in the payment of the borrower\'s loan and the loan should be transferred to the borrower\'s account. Borrowing is specified in the internal contract. Half an hour after the purchase, if the borrower signs the contract but does not comply with the terms, the company considers it a serious fraud and will take the credit dispute to the people\'s court. The anti-contract king is also presented. After purchase, if the lender does not lend on time, the borrower has the right to sue directly in the local court.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Article 10</strong></p>\r\n<p>This short loan agreement takes effect from the date of its signing by both parties (including the electronic agreement). The text of the contract has the same legal effect. The lender and borrower keep a copy of the contract.</p>\r\n<p>Lender: Credit</p>\r\n<p>Borrower:</p>\";s:15:\"currency_symbol\";s:1:\"$\";s:20:\"default_credit_score\";s:2:\"30\";s:14:\"default_locale\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"faqs_json\";s:1284:\"[{\"q\":\"What are the loan terms?\",\"a\":\"Step one, you have to fill all your personal information required in the application and you need to have an ID card or any of equivalent identification and a bank account to apply for the loan.\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take to apply for a loan each time?\",\"a\":\"From the time of registration, verification of personal information will be considered at the earliest and will continue till the final stage of delivery within 1 hour, please contact customer service staff for more specific information.\"},{\"q\":\"How to check loan?\",\"a\":\"You can visit (website) - (List of Loan Criteria) It usually takes 1-24 hours to get approved\"},{\"q\":\"How to get refund after credit line is approved?\",\"a\":\"After the loan is successful, the payment method will be deducted from your bank account on 15th of every month. If the balance is not enough to pay off, it will adversely affect your information and lead to bad debts in future.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I contact the service?\",\"a\":\"You can contact (Customer Service) Customer Service Contact Department Online Time 11:00AM - 11:00PM\"},{\"q\":\"Can I sign out of my account?\",\"a\":\"Monthly service that partially \\\"cancels your account\\\" information you enter for personal protection is limited to loan applications.\"}]\";s:12:\"home_sliders\";s:361:\"[\"isiahlendingcom\\/slides\\/j3xWhufR4UBVsOMTIIv2Ab97suFq40zN2THfRLY9.jpg\",\"isiahlendingcom\\/slides\\/I9rGeeGkmwpyj6eX1DGU793gVZ0AuiHGlf4KhICP.jpg\",\"isiahlendingcom\\/slides\\/SaZB1Wo6zG0gP6d01phbkTbYQRxsIEJCtSWZzvSa.jpg\",\"isiahlendingcom\\/slides\\/VCX5e47ngOVoZxCiZG4ZbFV84wM8SwS0eReoKulv.jpg\",\"isiahlendingcom\\/slides\\/wIOcFM5ZSc8BbYNAX7YxWPJqEz9zvryfd4oXwxXd.jpg\"]\";s:18:\"loan_interest_rate\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:8:\"loan_max\";s:7:\"5000000\";s:8:\"loan_min\";s:5:\"80000\";s:17:\"loan_requirements\";s:175:\"{\"full_name\":true,\"id_number\":true,\"id_front\":true,\"id_back\":true,\"id_selfie\":true,\"signature\":true,\"bank_name\":true,\"bank_account\":true,\"relative_1\":false,\"relative_2\":false}\";s:10:\"loan_terms\";s:20:\"[\"6\",\"12\",\"24\",\"36\"]\";s:9:\"logo_path\";s:50:\"loanlocal/42f9dfe0-a42b-4f27-b4bf-e4dbbb5ec00f.jpg\";s:18:\"page_about_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"page_contact_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"page_contract_visible\";s:1:\"0\";s:15:\"show_logo_login\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"show_logo_signup\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"theme\";s:7:\"default\";s:15:\"welcome_message\";s:19:\"Welcome to LoanApp!\";s:19:\"welcome_sub_message\";s:70:\"Thanks for creating your account. We are excited to have you on board.\";s:13:\"welcome_title\";s:7:\"Welcome\";}',1774963565);
INSERT INTO `cache` VALUES ('loanapp-cache-settings.map.null','a:24:{s:8:\"loan_min\";s:5:\"80000\";s:8:\"loan_max\";s:7:\"5000000\";s:18:\"loan_interest_rate\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:10:\"loan_terms\";s:20:\"[\"6\",\"12\",\"24\",\"36\"]\";s:5:\"theme\";s:7:\"default\";s:9:\"faqs_json\";s:1284:\"[{\"q\":\"What are the loan terms?\",\"a\":\"Step one, you have to fill all your personal information required in the application and you need to have an ID card or any of equivalent identification and a bank account to apply for the loan.\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take to apply for a loan each time?\",\"a\":\"From the time of registration, verification of personal information will be considered at the earliest and will continue till the final stage of delivery within 1 hour, please contact customer service staff for more specific information.\"},{\"q\":\"How to check loan?\",\"a\":\"You can visit (website) - (List of Loan Criteria) It usually takes 1-24 hours to get approved\"},{\"q\":\"How to get refund after credit line is approved?\",\"a\":\"After the loan is successful, the payment method will be deducted from your bank account on 15th of every month. If the balance is not enough to pay off, it will adversely affect your information and lead to bad debts in future.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I contact the service?\",\"a\":\"You can contact (Customer Service) Customer Service Contact Department Online Time 11:00AM - 11:00PM\"},{\"q\":\"Can I sign out of my account?\",\"a\":\"Monthly service that partially \\\"cancels your account\\\" information you enter for personal protection is limited to loan applications.\"}]\";s:17:\"loan_requirements\";s:173:\"{\"full_name\":true,\"id_number\":true,\"id_front\":true,\"id_back\":true,\"id_selfie\":true,\"signature\":true,\"bank_name\":true,\"bank_account\":true,\"relative_1\":true,\"relative_2\":true}\";s:14:\"default_locale\";s:2:\"en\";s:12:\"home_sliders\";s:554:\"[\"fastservicesolutioncom\\/slides\\/zZTyjgqnujOimscXbCSkX7UEEwMAM9vaOfRdI6q8