INSERT INTO `settings` VALUES (131,8,'about_us','<p><strong>LoanApp &amp; Financial Services Inc</strong></p>\r\n<p>CASH 2 GO FINANCE, INC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;SERVICESAddress: 2ND LEVEL , ACE CENTERPOINT, , CITY OF KORONADAL (Capital), SOUTH COTABATO, REGION XII (SOCCSKSARGEN)<br>&nbsp;Registration Number: CS201329826</p>\r\n<p>Certificate of Authority Number: 1069 Date of Registration: June 5, 2013</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since 2013, CASH 2 GO FINANCE, INC. &nbsp;has been a trusted full-service universal loan application provider in the Philippines. We are committed to delivering fast, convenient, and reliable financial solutions tailored to the needs of Filipinos and businesses nationwide. Our focus is to provide an easy and secure process for accessing loan services, offering competitive interest rates and quick approvals.</p>\r\n<p>Over the years, we have assisted thousands of clients across the country, consistently earning strong referrals and high service ratings for our dependable and efficient loan programs.</p>\r\n<p>We offer seamless document handling and help clients complete all loan requirements&mdash;including freelancers, OFWs, and non-traditional earners&mdash;without requiring collateral. Through our local subsidiaries, we maintain strong partnerships with major banks in the Philippines, providing access to a wide range of financial products such as:</p>\r\n<p>Banking Loans<br>Private Loans<br>Leasing and Finance Personal<br>Loans<br>Loan Insurance<br>OFW&nbsp;<br>Our advantage lies in providing value-added financial services, enabling us to build long-standing relationships with clients throughout the country.</p>\r\n<p>Cash 2 Go Finance, Inc. remains at the forefront of fast, easy, and dependable loan service facilitation. Through strategic acquisitions and steady growth, we have strengthened our financial position and expanded into new markets. Today, the company continues on its path to becoming one of the Philippines&rsquo; leading local &amp; OFW loan service providers in terms of total resources, customer loans, capital strength, and nationwide network.</p>',NULL,NULL);
